ContractView014 = build_contract_view([{'api_id': 'API-MDL-020', 'app': 'ai_analysis', 'domain': 'AI Model Admin', 'api_name': 'AI 모델 버전 사용 종료', 'method': 'POST', 'endpoint': '/api/v1/ai-model-versions/{version_id}/retire', 'django_path': 'api/v1/ai-model-versions/<uuid:version_id>/retire', 'roles': ['SYSTEM_ADMIN'], 'permission': 'ai.model.manage', 'service_scope': None, 'request_contract': 'Path: version_id: UUID, 필수\nBody: {"reason":"지원 종료","confirmation":true}', 'validation': 'SYSTEM_ADMIN + ai.model.manage\n• 현재 validation_status=DRAFT|VALIDATED|APPROVED\n• is_active=false\n• 해당 Version을 참조하는 ACTIVE RoutingConfig 없음\n• 진행 중(QUEUED/PROCESSING/RETRYING) AIAnalysis가 해당 Version을 사용하지 않음\n• confirmation=true, reason 필수', 'related_db': 'ModelVersion (ai_modelversion)\nAIRoutingConfigVersion (ai_airoutingconfigversion)\nAuditLog (audit_auditlog)\nOutboxEvent (common_outboxevent)', 'processing': '• ModelVersion 및 참조 Routing/활성 Job 확인을 위해 잠금\n• validation_status→RETIRED\n• 이후 activate/rollback/신규 routing/실패 Job retry 대상에서 제외\n• 기존 완료 AIAnalysis의 model_version_id Snapshot은 유지\n• AuditLog·Outbox 저장', 'response_contract': 'version_id,validation_status="RETIRED"', 'success': '200 OK', 'error_contract': 'AUTH_REQUIRED(401)\nMODEL_RETIRE_FORBIDDEN(403)\nAI_MODEL_VERSION_NOT_FOUND(404)\nMODEL_RETIRE_INVALID_STATE(409)\nMODEL_VERSION_ACTIVE(409)\nMODEL_VERSION_ACTIVE_ROUTING(409)\nMODEL_VERSION_IN_USE(409)\nCONFIRMATION_REQUIRED(422)', 'transaction': 'O(필수: ModelVersion+AuditLog+Outbox 원자화)', 'transactional': True, 'event': 'ai.model_version.retired.v1', 'note': '원본 RETIRED 상태 유지', 'primary_model': 'ai_analysis.ModelVersion', 'audit_required': True}])
